{"seq":10,"slug":"engineering-mgmt","title":"工程管理","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt","introMarkdown":"# 工程管理 简介\n\n工程管理研究的是如何把一项庞大而复杂的工程——一座大桥、一栋写字楼、一条地铁线、一座芯片工厂——在有限的时间、预算和资源约束下，安全、优质地从图纸变为现实。它处在工程技术与管理科学的交叉地带：既要懂土木、机电、信息这些专业语言，又要会算账、排进度、控质量、防风险、协调成百上千名参与者。一个再精妙的设计，如果工期失控、成本超支、质量出问题，仍然是失败的工程。工程管理正是为了解决\"如何把事情做成\"这个根本问题而存在的学科。\n\n这门学科的现实意义极其直接。港珠澳大桥历时九年、投资超千亿，涉及上百家单位协同；一个普通的城市综合体项目，参与方也常常超过五十家。这些项目稍有不慎就会出现\"工期拖一年、成本翻一倍\"的灾难——著名的悉尼歌剧院原计划 4 年、700 万澳元完工，最终拖到 14 年、1.02 亿澳元，超支十几倍。工程管理提供的，正是让大型项目\"不失控\"的系统方法：用进度计划预判工期，用工程经济学比较方案的真实成本，用质量与安全体系守住底线，用挣值等控制技术在过程中及时纠偏。\n\n本学习空间将工程管理的核心内容组织为四个章节。**第一章 项目管理基础** 建立项目的全生命周期视角，介绍项目的三重约束、利益相关方管理以及主流的管理知识体系，是理解后续所有内容的地基。**第二章 工程经济学** 讨论如何用货币的时间价值、现金流分析和多方案比选，来回答\"这个项目值不值得做\"\"哪个方案更划算\"这类投资决策问题。**第三章 工程质量与安全管理** 聚焦工程的两条生命线——质量缺陷会埋下隐患，安全事故会带来人命代价，本章介绍质量控制体系、PDCA 循环和现代安全管理理念。**第四章 项目控制技术** 是工程管理的\"硬功夫\"，涵盖网络计划技术（关键路径法）、挣值管理和工程风险管理，教你在项目执行过程中如何量化进度与成本、识别并应对风险。\n\n学习工程管理最有效的方式是\"带着真实项目去思考\"。建议你选定一个身边或新闻里熟悉的工程——小区改造、地铁建设、一次装修——在学习每个工具时都尝试套用它：这个项目的关键路径是什么？它的现金流何时回正？质量和安全的关键控制点在哪？这种把抽象方法落到具体工程上的训练，能帮你真正建立起工程管理者的思维方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-management-foundations","title":"项目管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-management-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-and-triple-constraint","title":"大学工程管理 — 项目与三重约束","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-management-foundations/project-and-triple-constraint"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stakeholders-and-organization","title":"大学工程管理 — 利益相关方与项目组织","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-management-foundations/stakeholders-and-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pmbok-knowledge-areas","title":"大学工程管理 — 项目管理知识体系（PMBOK）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-management-foundations/pmbok-knowledge-areas"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"engineering-economics","title":"工程经济学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"time-value-of-money","title":"大学工程管理 — 货币的时间价值","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/time-value-of-money"},{"seq":2,"slug":"investment-appraisal-criteria","title":"大学工程管理 — 投资评价指标（NPV / IRR / 回收期）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/investment-appraisal-criteria"},{"seq":3,"slug":"alternatives-comparison","title":"大学工程管理 — 多方案比选与敏感性分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/engineering-economics/alternatives-comparison"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"construction-quality-safety","title":"工程质量与安全管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-management-system","title":"大学工程管理 — 质量管理体系与 PDCA","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety/quality-management-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quality-control-tools","title":"大学工程管理 — 质量控制七工具","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety/quality-control-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"construction-safety-management","title":"大学工程管理 — 工程安全管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/construction-quality-safety/construction-safety-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"project-control-techniques","title":"项目控制技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-cpm","title":"大学工程管理 — 网络计划技术与关键路径法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques/network-cpm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"earned-value-management","title":"大学工程管理 — 挣值管理（EVM）","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques/earned-value-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-risk-management","title":"大学工程管理 — 工程风险管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/engineering-mgmt/project-control-techniques/project-risk-management"}]}]}